{{{#!style
.article-tab { display: inline-block; padding: 4px 12px; border: 1px solid light-dark(#ccc, #555); border-bottom: none; cursor: pointer; }
.article-panel { display: none; border: 1px solid light-dark(#ccc, #555); padding: 8px; }
.article-tabs.article-t0 .article-tab0 { background: #2f5d50; color: #fff; }
.article-tabs.article-t0 .article-panel0 { display: block; }
.article-tabs.article-t1 .article-tab1 { background: #2f5d50; color: #fff; }
.article-tabs.article-t1 .article-panel1 { display: block; }
.article-tabs.article-t2 .article-tab2 { background: #2f5d50; color: #fff; }
.article-tabs.article-t2 .article-panel2 { display: block; }
.article-fold { border: 1px solid light-dark(#ddd, #444); margin: 4px 0; }
.article-fold-title { display: block; background: light-dark(#f4f4f4, #2d2f34); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: pointer; }
.article-fold-body { display: none; padding: 8px; }
.article-fold.article-open .article-fold-body { display: block; }

}}}[목차]
== 개요 ==
[[허균]]이 지었다고 전하는 [[조선]]의 [[한글 소설]].

== 판본 ==
