{{{#!wiki tag="a" class="article_node_7 article-tab article-tab0" onclick="remove-class,article_node_6,article-t1;remove-class,article_node_6,article-t2;add-class,article_node_6,article-t0"
경판본}}}{{{#!wiki tag="a" class="article_node_8 article-tab article-tab1" onclick="remove-class,article_node_6,article-t0;remove-class,article_node_6,article-t2;add-class,article_node_6,article-t1"
완판본}}}{{{#!wiki tag="a" class="article_node_9 article-tab article-tab2" onclick="remove-class,article_node_6,article-t0;remove-class,article_node_6,article-t1;add-class,article_node_6,article-t2"
필사본}}}{{{#!wiki class="article_node_10 article-panel article-panel0"
'''경판 24장본'''은 가장 널리 읽힌 판본이다.[* 서울에서 찍어 낸 방각본.]}}}{{{#!wiki class="article_node_11 article-panel article-panel1"
'''완판 36장본'''은 전라도 전주에서 간행되었다. 율도국 이야기가 길다.}}}{{{#!wiki class="article_node_12 article-panel article-panel2"
여러 필사본이 전하며 결말이 조금씩 다르다.}}}}}}
